{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31575","headline":"哭郴州王使君 · 李羣玉","name":"哭郴州王使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"银章朱绂照云骢，六换鱼书惠化崇。\n瑶树忽倾沧海里，醉乡翻在夜台中。\n东山妓逐飞花散，北海尊随逝水空。\n曾是绮罗筵上客，一来长恸向春风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31575.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31575","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}